{"unit_id":"ConsoleSun__Gemini-Eyes#feature-1","repo":"ConsoleSun/Gemini-Eyes","commit":"fe5b6f47775b5114abae291698d68c4d7b95c377","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Gemini Eyes 的功能「网页对话」：向 Gemini 发送提示并返回回答、会话和响应标识。通过 gemini_send_message 调用，可传入本地文件，并使用会话标识续聊。","source":"generated","evidence":["gemini_mcp/server.py:329"]}
{"unit_id":"ConsoleSun__Gemini-Eyes#feature-2","repo":"ConsoleSun/Gemini-Eyes","commit":"fe5b6f47775b5114abae291698d68c4d7b95c377","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Gemini Eyes 的功能「图片与视频分析」：上传一个本地图片或视频并返回 Gemini 的描述。调用 gemini_analyze_media 时可提供自定义提示词，也可指定已有会话继续交流。","source":"generated","evidence":["gemini_mcp/server.py:365"]}
{"unit_id":"ConsoleSun__Gemini-Eyes#feature-3","repo":"ConsoleSun/Gemini-Eyes","commit":"fe5b6f47775b5114abae291698d68c4d7b95c377","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Gemini Eyes 的功能「生成图片」：根据文本提示生成图片，也可传参考图片进行编辑；调用 gemini_generate_image 后将生成媒体下载到指定目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["gemini_mcp/server.py:397"]}
{"unit_id":"ConsoleSun__Gemini-Eyes#feature-4","repo":"ConsoleSun/Gemini-Eyes","commit":"fe5b6f47775b5114abae291698d68c4d7b95c377","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Gemini Eyes 的功能「生成视频」：提交文本提示后轮询会话直到视频可用或达到等待时限，并尝试将成品保存到指定目录。通过 gemini_generate_video 触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["gemini_mcp/server.py:428"]}
{"unit_id":"ConsoleSun__Gemini-Eyes#feature-5","repo":"ConsoleSun/Gemini-Eyes","commit":"fe5b6f47775b5114abae291698d68c4d7b95c377","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Gemini Eyes 的「会话管理」可列出、读取或删除历史对话，分别调用三个会话管理工具。","source":"generated","evidence":["gemini_mcp/server.py:501","gemini_mcp/server.py:519","gemini_mcp/server.py:539"]}
{"unit_id":"ConsoleSun__Gemini-Eyes#feature-6","repo":"ConsoleSun/Gemini-Eyes","commit":"fe5b6f47775b5114abae291698d68c4d7b95c377","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Gemini Eyes 的功能「登录状态诊断」：检查 Cookie 可用性、缺少的 Cookie 和 Gemini 会话令牌状态。调用 gemini_status 获得诊断结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["gemini_mcp/server.py:295"]}
